     "summary": "Adds \u00a717-3-0600, transit-oriented development (TOD) streets: N Western Ave 3600\u20134859 N and N Ravenswood Ave 4001\u20134799 N. Eight uses are prohibited on lots abutting a TOD street, and a rezoning of abutting property must be to a B or C1 district with a FAR of at least 3. It also amends \u00a717-3-0308(2) and adds a definition at \u00a717-17-02177.5. Effective on passage.",
